{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":[],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Read existing schedules and their backend status, preview a proposed schedule, or save a detached schedule draft that no bot uses yet. The list and status actions are read-only. A running bot's schedule can never be changed here: a bot and its schedule are one thing. To run a bot at a different time, stop it with stop_deployment and start a new one with start_deployment and the schedule you want; the owner approves both.\n\nSet \"action\" to choose the operation. Only send the fields listed for that action.\n\n## action=\"preview\": Preview a schedule policy\nRequired fields: scheduleMetadata.\nPreview how BotSpot would route a proposed scheduleMetadata object. This does not start a bot. Use this before starting a scheduled bot with start_deployment.\n\n## action=\"create\": Save a schedule draft\nRequired fields: strategyId, scheduleMetadata.\nSaves a detached schedule draft that no bot uses yet, for example to show the owner a proposed schedule. It never touches a running bot. Initial schedules use start_deployment. To change an existing bot schedule, use update_deployment_revision with the requested scheduled mode and exact schedule. The owner reviews one Update approval on the website before replacement.\n\n## action=\"list\": List schedules\nNo other fields required.\nLists intended schedule policies and current Bot Manager backend truth for the signed-in user, including runtime drift.\n\n## action=\"status\": Get schedule status\nRequired fields: schedulePolicyId.\nReturns one intended schedule policy plus its current backend schedules, expressions, timezone, enabled state, policy hash, and drift.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"description":"Which operation to run: \"preview\", \"create\", \"list\", \"status\". See the tool description for each one.","enum":["preview","create","list","status"],"type":"string"},"deploymentMode":{"default":"auto","description":"Used with action=\"preview\".","enum":["auto","always_on","scheduled"],"type":"string"},"idempotencyKey":{"description":"Used with action=\"create\".","maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"revisionId":{"description":"Used with action=\"create\".","format":"uuid","type":"string"},"scheduleMetadata":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"Used with action=\"preview\", action=\"create\". Required for action=\"preview\", action=\"create\".","properties":{"backtestCadence":{"maxLength":240,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"billingRoute":{"enum":["scheduled","always_on"],"type":"string"},"cadence":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"anchorTime":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"intervalSeconds":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"integer"},"type":{"const":"interval","type":"string"}},"required":["type","intervalSeconds"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"daysOfWeek":{"items":{"maximum":6,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"maxItems":7,"type":"array"},"times":{"items":{"maxLength":16,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":48,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"timezone":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":{"const":"specific_times","type":"string"}},"required":["type","times","timezone"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"daysOfWeek":{"items":{"maximum":6,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"times":{"items":{"maxLength":16,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":48,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"timezone":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":{"const":"weekly","type":"string"}},"required":["type","daysOfWeek","times","timezone"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"daysOfMonth":{"items":{"maximum":31,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"ordinalWeekday":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ordinal":{"maximum":5,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"weekday":{"maximum":6,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["ordinal","weekday"],"type":"object"},"times":{"items":{"maxLength":16,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":48,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"timezone":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":{"const":"monthly","type":"string"}},"required":["type","times","timezone"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"event":{"enum":["open","close"],"type":"string"},"market":{"enum":["US_EQUITIES","ALWAYS_OPEN"],"type":"string"},"offsetMinutes":{"default":0,"maximum":240,"minimum":-240,"type":"integer"},"timezone":{"default":"America/New_York","maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":{"const":"market_event","type":"string"}},"required":["type","market","event"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"eventType":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":{"const":"event_window","type":"string"},"windows":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"durationMinutes":{"maximum":1440,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"endAt":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"kind":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"label":{"maxLength":160,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"source":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"startAfterApprovalMinutes":{"maximum":1440,"minimum":3,"type":"integer"},"startAt":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"timezone":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"maxItems":200,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["type","eventType","windows"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"daysOfWeek":{"items":{"maximum":6,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"endTime":{"pattern":"^([01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d$","type":"string"},"shutdownGraceSeconds":{"default":0,"maximum":3600,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"startIfInsideWin